The law can't be more generous.

00:33:53.120 --> 00:33:53.960
Unless...

00:33:54.400 --> 00:33:57.640
Unless you have the command from the First Warfare Command.

00:33:59.040 --> 00:34:00.120
Otherwise,

00:34:03.680 --> 00:34:04.800
I can't help you.

00:34:19.960 --> 00:34:22.360
What if I ask you as your sister?

00:34:28.679 --> 00:34:29.600
Brother.

00:34:45.880 --> 00:34:47.840
You finally acknowledge me, right?

00:35:03.880 --> 00:35:04.880
Now,

00:35:05.960 --> 00:35:08.720
finally acknowledge me.

00:35:12.200 --> 00:35:13.000
Do you know

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:14.760
when I first saw you,

00:35:14.760 --> 00:35:16.640
I was sure you were Wen Pei.

00:35:20.840 --> 00:35:20.960
A, lion, 30, army.
Travel 72.

00:35:21.120 --> 00:35:22.680
As a reporter,

00:35:22.680 --> 00:35:23.720
as a military commander,

00:35:23.720 --> 00:35:25.440
appeared beside me,

00:35:29.480 --> 00:35:30.880
I didn't dare to ask.

00:35:31.520 --> 00:35:32.880
I'm afraid you'll be in danger.

00:35:33.280 --> 00:35:35.040
I know you have a mission.

00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:38.400
Do you know why I sent someone

00:35:38.400 --> 00:35:40.200
to follow you 24 hours a day?

00:35:41.560 --> 00:35:43.520
Why did I save Shangguan eagle

00:35:43.520 --> 00:35:44.680
I went to save her.

00:35:45.240 --> 00:35:46.160
For the sake of public interest.

00:35:47.400 --> 00:35:48.800
Yes, I know.

00:35:53.960 --> 00:35:55.400
I have a mission.

00:35:56.600 --> 00:35:58.400
so I had to hide it from you.

00:36:03.120 --> 00:36:04.280
I'm sorry.

00:36:21.040 --> 00:36:22.000
You've grown up.

00:36:26.320 --> 00:36:28.200
I don't even dare to recognize you.

00:36:39.200 --> 00:36:42.560
We can meet again today.

00:36:43.120 --> 00:36:45.880
We should thank our father for his blessing.

00:36:58.800 --> 00:37:00.760
Ni, where are you going?

00:37:01.040 --> 00:37:02.160
I'm looking for my mother.

00:37:02.360 --> 00:37:03.960
My mother hasn't come back yet.

00:37:04.240 --> 00:37:05.880
Uncle Liu, did you see her?

00:37:07.400 --> 00:37:08.480
I didn't notice.

00:37:09.600 --> 00:37:10.920
I'll look for it.

00:37:14.080 --> 00:37:16.520
She's always in a hurry.

00:37:22.040 --> 00:37:22.840
Brother.

00:37:25.880 --> 00:37:29.240
I know your father's death is a big blow to you.

00:37:31.760 --> 00:37:34.320
But it has nothing to do with Bao.

00:37:40.240 --> 00:37:41.240
It has nothing to do with him.

00:37:43.800 --> 00:37:45.800
Do you know what he is now?

00:37:46.600 --> 00:37:48.080
He's a Communist Party.

00:37:48.760 --> 00:37:50.440
We are the Republican Party.

00:37:51.240 --> 00:37:53.080
We're in different levels.

00:37:53.080 --> 00:37:54.720
And don't forget one thing.

00:37:56.480 --> 00:37:58.520
Our biological father was killed by the Communist Party.

00:37:58.520 --> 00:38:00.760
The Communist Party had blood on his hands.

00:38:00.920 --> 00:38:03.080
We were young when my father died.

00:38:03.440 --> 00:38:05.080
What does it have to do with him?

00:38:06.080 --> 00:38:07.880
Besides, his father is dead.

00:38:09.880 --> 00:38:11.160
I don't care.

00:38:11.160 --> 00:38:13.040
But he's a commie, right?

00:38:13.400 --> 00:38:14.960
I've been suspecting that

00:38:15.200 --> 00:38:17.160
my father's death wasn't that simple.

00:38:18.480 --> 00:38:19.800
Before I find out the truth,

00:38:19.800 --> 00:38:21.280
I hope you won't target him.

00:38:24.120 --> 00:38:25.960
The three of us grew up together.

00:38:28.560 --> 00:38:29.960
For me,

00:38:30.840 --> 00:38:32.680
are also our family.

00:38:33.840 --> 00:38:36.640
Bao is your family.

00:38:41.320 --> 00:38:42.280
Who am I?

00:38:43.960 --> 00:38:45.480
Am I your family?

00:38:46.000 --> 00:38:48.240
He's your family. Is he looking for you?

00:38:48.800 --> 00:38:51.240
I've been looking for you for so many years.

00:38:56.120 --> 00:38:58.320
Don't tell me you like him.

00:39:02.400 --> 00:39:03.320
No.

00:39:03.520 --> 00:39:04.440
That's good.

00:39:06.720 --> 00:39:08.120
Forget it.

00:39:08.720 --> 00:39:09.640
I was wrong.

00:39:10.360 --> 00:39:13.120
I can't watch you cry.

00:39:15.760 --> 00:39:18.160
I'm happy today.

00:39:22.320 --> 00:39:24.360
I'll ask them to prepare some dishes.

00:39:24.720 --> 00:39:26.360
Let's have a good chat.

00:39:26.360 --> 00:39:28.000
What have you been doing these years?

00:39:28.560 --> 00:39:29.560
Brother.

00:39:31.120 --> 00:39:32.360
No matter what,

00:39:32.360 --> 00:39:33.680
I'll take the buns with me.

00:39:34.800 --> 00:39:35.920
Sorry.

00:39:38.440 --> 00:39:39.360
Come in.

00:39:47.000 --> 00:39:48.160
I suspect

00:39:49.000 --> 00:39:51.440
Brigade Commander Cui is suspected of colluding.

00:39:51.840 --> 00:39:54.000
Take him away for investigation.

00:39:54.680 --> 00:39:57.800
Also, my informant Chae was arrested by him.

00:39:58.480 --> 00:39:59.880
Release him now.

00:40:00.560 --> 00:40:02.640
Drop your guns and get out.

00:40:05.520 --> 00:40:06.320
Get out!

00:41:09.360 --> 00:41:10.720
Where did he go?

00:41:36.520 --> 00:41:38.280
You're making a big joke.

00:41:38.760 --> 00:41:40.520
A real sister who has been waiting for her return.

00:41:40.800 --> 00:41:41.960
pointed a gun at him

00:41:41.960 --> 00:41:43.520
and put him in jail.

00:41:43.520 --> 00:41:44.880
Cui Wenkui

00:41:44.880 --> 00:41:46.240
must hate me so much.

00:41:47.200 --> 00:41:48.520
I had no choice.

00:41:49.480 --> 00:41:51.000
In order to save you,

00:41:51.400 --> 00:41:53.560
in order to save you.

00:41:53.920 --> 00:41:54.800
How are you going to thank her?

00:41:55.160 --> 00:41:56.200
What else can I do?

00:41:56.600 --> 00:41:59.040
I'll take a few more bullets for her.

00:42:00.880 --> 00:42:01.800
By the way,

00:42:03.240 --> 00:42:04.320
What are you going to do next?

00:42:04.680 --> 00:42:05.880
I can't keep him locked up.

